.git
.venv
# Root-anchored: this is the local runtime canonical dir. WITHOUT the leading slash,
# gitignore semantics match at any depth and would silently drop examples/data/preset —
# the shipped demo bundles, which must be in the image for the seed step.
/data
apps/web/node_modules
apps/web/dist
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log
